      "Fix: various corrections in the analytics — Auftraggeber revenue and its jump to the sub-work list, paid ratio, aging table and top insurers.",
      "Fix: VAT export — receipts are now included.",
      "Fix: hail report — surcharges (glue, P2P) on panels with a fixed AW value.",
      "Fix: backup — failed backups are now reported with date and reason.",
